  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 12 01 03 01 01 01 02 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 DC 10}哈、哈、哈……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e822_400.bf.json:2:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_001",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}＞不知为何，虎狼丸似乎很开心……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e822_400.bf.json:3:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_002",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 10 01 0D 01 01 01 05 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 87 0B}检测到虎狼丸先生的脑波中\n出现了α波。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e822_400.bf.json:4:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_003",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 07 01 01 01 01 01 F5 02}{F5 86 0F 01 0D 01 65 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 FF 0A}出现α波的时候，我记得……\n是处于放松状态吧。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e822_400.bf.json:4:1",
  "message_id": "MSG_003",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}它是在神社长大的狗狗，\n是不是很熟悉这里的氛围呢？\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e822_400.bf.json:5:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_004",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 AA 0C}{F5 C1 04 01 01 01 01 01 02 01}汪汪！\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e822_400.bf.json:6:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_005",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F4 87 0C 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 86 01 01 02 01 01 01 02 01}{F5 86 0F 01 0D 01 65 01 04 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 96 11}那个，队长。\n如果有时间的话……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e822_400.bf.json:6:1",
  "message_id": "MSG_005",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}下次能不能\n带小虎去散散步？\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e822_400.bf.json:6:2",
  "message_id": "MSG_005",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}可以的话……就在这座迷宫里。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e822_400.bf.json:7:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_006",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 0E 01 0D 01 01 01 02 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 17 0A}山岸，这我不能同意。\n这里或许有它熟悉的氛围，\n但终究是阴影的巢穴。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e822_400.bf.json:8:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_007",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 0F 01 07 01 65 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 C3 0A}{F5 C1 03 01 01 01 01 01 0B 01}也、也是呢……！\n对不起……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e822_400.bf.json:9:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_008",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 12 01 02 01 01 01 07 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e822_400.bf.json:10:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_009",
